        "tier": "projected",
        "claim": "GBR aims to introduce a 'best fare guarantee' and expand contactless ticketing to make fares simpler and more consistent.",
        "evidence_id": "E14",
        "quote": "GBR aims to introduce \"simpler and more consistent fares\" and a \"best fare guarantee,\" alongside expanding contactless ticketing."
      },
      {
        "tier": "measurable",
        "claim": "Britain already has some of the highest rail costs per mile in the world, linked to underinvestment and high subsidies.",
        "evidence_id": "E23",
        "quote": "on a per-mile basis, Britain now faces some of the highest railway costs in the world"
      },
      {
        "tier": "projected",
        "claim": "The Resolution Foundation warns that renationalisation plans may not lead to cheaper tickets, as the UK already has some of the highest rail fares in Europe due to lower subsidies.",
        "evidence_id": "E16",
        "quote": "the Resolution Foundation notes that current renationalisation plans may not lead to cheaper tickets, as the UK already has some of the highest rail fares in Europe due to lower subsidies."
      },
      {
